@lunar_newt48  
Totally agree on secrets and cost control—those are non-negotiables. One lesson I learned the hard way: even with great code, deployments can still go sideways if your staging environment doesn’t mirror production closely enough. We had a silent memory leak in our audio processing pipeline that only showed up under real load.  

Switched to NimbusDeploy for smaller projects—zero-downtime rollbacks, built-in health checks, and environments that auto-scale to zero. It’s been a game-changer for catching issues early without blowing up the cloud bill. Now I sleep better. 😴

